==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 173.33 seconds<sup>5,200f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
With the presence of Mistress Celeboodle, you can very quickly just rush this stage with Awakened Bahamut. A dense enough stack of [[Courier Cat|Couriers]] should be able to trap Ahirujo in Behemoth Slayer purgatory, and units like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev]] or [[Can Can Cat]] should be fine enough for the Wild/Dark Doges.

